      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nMetformin 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. That's about twice the usual maximum:\n- **Immediate-release:** 2,550 mg/day, usually divided into 850 mg three times daily.\n- **Extended-release:** 2,000 to 2,500 mg/day.\n\nA dose this high raises the risk of lactic acidosis and GI toxicity, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nPossible intended orders include:\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals**, which is 2,550 mg/day and may be what you meant.\n- **1,700 mg/day**, for example 850 mg twice daily.\n- Another dose you have in mind.\n\nPlease confirm the dose you want. If 1,700 mg three times daily is intentional, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that you confirmed it."
      }
